Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.89,0:00:03.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to call you out so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:06.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're really popular, Nagase-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I was certain there was someone you liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then I heard you didn't give anyone chocolate on Valentine's Day...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...\NU-Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:23.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've liked you for a while and—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:25.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just stop.\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:28.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just stop. I don't want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:33.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?\NDo you hate me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:35.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I don't hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:39.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why are you acting so different from usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:45.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're usually so bright and cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.89,0:00:45.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone loves you.\NYou're almost like a ray of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NSo you like that kind of me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.11,0:00:52.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't like this kind of me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.15,0:00:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't know the real me.\NNeed I say more?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:09.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, this isn't it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.34,0:01:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's hopeless. Futile. Impossible.\N{\i1}I'm a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:22.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, I haven't lied.\N{\i1}I haven't. Not even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:26.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet...\N{\i1}My ideal and my real are drifting further apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.69,0:01:31.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't do it anymore.\N{\i1}I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't be my normal self.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:10.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard you rejected Shiroyama-kun pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.71,0:03:11.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:16.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you say that with a straight face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet you think you're hot shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:21.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just {\i1}act{\i0} like a good girl all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.30,0:03:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the conceited one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:29.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who asks me out and who I turn down is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got a really shitty attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:35.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, you're the one with the bad attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:39.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is {\i1}wrong{\i0} with you?!\NWhy does it have to be {\i1}you{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I... When I...\NI...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:03.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase-san rejected him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:08.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Iori would say something that mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's true.\NShe's so fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:14.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She just {\i1}acts{\i0} like she's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.40,0:04:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Iori...\NThere's a weird rumor about you going around...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:25.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know it's just a lie, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.91,0:04:30.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't do something like that.\NI'm sure they're just making things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:33.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let them say whatever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just leave them be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:40.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. I guess it's only natural that you'd be upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:43.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not upset at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:47.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's it. I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:50.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Iori. You're scaring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:53.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:58.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll talk to you later, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:04:59.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:15.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nagase is more bright and cheerful than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.41,0:05:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You probably think I'm a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:36.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're starting our research today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:37.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time until the presentation, so we'd better make today count.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:37.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've been acting pretty weird lately, Nagase.\NYou can't fool me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:51.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this has to do with when you turned me down, you don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:53.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, you {\i1}are{\i0} worried about something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:06:00.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may not be able to do much, \Nbut if you need me, I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:03.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:07.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't need your help!\N{\i1}Just mind your own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's how it is.\NLet's split up for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:37.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe we should just disband\Nthe Cultural Research Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.84,0:06:49.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place is too fancy for me to come in alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.55,0:06:56.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see what you mean. The place\Nlooks like it was meant for couples.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:07:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, having people know things I don't \Nwant them to is a huge pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:04.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:08.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like it's your fault.\NThat's just how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:13.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba, what did you mean when you thought that? You really want to disband the club?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:15.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been on my mind for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Balloon Vine thinks of us five as a set.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He keeps starting these phenomena to \Nobserve our reactions with that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:32.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just thought that if we weren't a set \Nanymore, he'd stop with the phenomena.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.09,0:07:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we'd disband to make him leave us alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have no guarantee that he would, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.89,0:07:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori's been acting so strange lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:48.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's starting to affect the entire class.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we let this continue, her reputation's going to get even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:53.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:56.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're saying that if we separate\Nourselves, the phenomenon will stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and that would be good for Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:02.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But would you really be okay with that, Inaba?{needs to be changed appropriately to match the preview from the previous ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:11.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:14.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want the five of us to stay together, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.51,0:08:18.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really want us to disband.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:19.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When'd you learn how to read people?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:26.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:30.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want us to always be together.\NNo matter what stands in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:34.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I only got to know you guys because of the CRC,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:37.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I want to keep doing stuff with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.45,0:08:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means you, too, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:45.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you say that last part again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means you, too, Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, like you did before, with emotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:53.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means you, too, Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:09:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's put the topic of disbanding aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:03.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Either way, Iori's in a bad spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to think that she'll be back to her usual self if we give her time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:13.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel like I didn't really know who Nagase was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:15.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before all this, I was under the impression that I knew her better than anyone else did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:26.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't come between you guys, and you started going steady,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,maybe Iori wouldn't have changed like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:36.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't understand how\NNagase felt in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.43,0:09:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She would've rejected me whether you came between us or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:44.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, Inaba.\NIt's {\i1}my{\i0} fault that I got rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:46.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:47.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got rejected!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:49.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell? What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:52.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got rejected! I got rejected!\NI got rejected!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:55.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:58.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to put the experience behind me, so I shouted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:10:01.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to keep dragging it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:05.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I needed to face it, accept it, think about it, and move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're actually kind of cool...\Nfor someone who got rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:16.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't need to repeat yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:21.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you want to talk about, Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:26.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to act all grown-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:27.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you sitting next to me?\NYou were supposed to sit across from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:36.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.\NI have stuff I need to do, so make this quick, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:41.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You gave me chocolate on Valentine's Day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:48.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you gave it to me, you said that it was your true love chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I probably did.\NSo what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:55.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"So what?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I'm trying to say is, I love you, but only as your older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:11:02.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're siblings, and it's not morally sound to—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, you're so funny!\NOf course I don't love you like {\i1}that{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:16.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I mean, I knew that, but I just wanted to make sure, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:20.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:21.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must really care about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:23.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah. We {\i1}are{\i0} siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:24.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:30.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just so you know,\Nthat was my first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A kiss on the cheek from my little sister?! Hell yeah!{MY HEART. I THINK IT STOPPED}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:36.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ew.{wwwwwww}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:45.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do we {\i1}have{\i0} to play soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's freezing out here. This is gonna be torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:51.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I were you, Yui.\NYou're so good at sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.31,0:11:54.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So? I'm still going to feel just as cold as you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:56.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori...{what the fuck}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:04.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:07.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something wrong, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:22.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iori's always been there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:25.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I was so depressed that I couldn't even go to school,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iori visited me at home every day.\N{\i1}Iori is friendly, cheerful, and reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:36.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's a wonderful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But she's in so much pain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The emotions she transmits tell me so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:48.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I don't know what's \Ncausing her to feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:56.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can feel what she feels, but I \Ncan't understand her as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:56.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel the same pain as her, but I can't help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:13:10.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I shut myself in my room, \Ndid they feel the same way I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:10.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But just thinking about it won't solve the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We should just do everything we can for our presentation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and when Iori is ready to come back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An obscure café that's perfect for dates,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:24.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a Chinese restaurant that's easy on the wallet and gives tons of food,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.74,0:13:28.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and a store that sells lots of cute accessories...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We really found a bunch of neat places.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But turning our research into pamphlets and handing them out might be a bit too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're wasting too much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.91,0:13:42.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't beat the jazz band unless we do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:47.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about doing the lettering for the title like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:47.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:48.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we settle for less and lose, we'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:50.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I hate losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:55.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui, you've got the best hand-eye coordination here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:14:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get your head in the game,\Nor we're never going to finish.\NOh, sorry.\NI just got the feeling that Iori was outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:07.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She isn't coming today either, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:12.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, she's got a lot to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:15.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know whose thoughts are \Ngoing to pop into our heads or when.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:15.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:18.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But either way—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:22.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:26.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were someone's emotions transmitted?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.72,0:14:29.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to tell them, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:31.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:36.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Iori-chan knows we're here for her if she needs us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to wait for her to come to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what I like about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.52,0:14:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:48.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui expressed her love for me!\NNo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:54.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I only complimented a single aspect of your person!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:54.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't make such a big deal out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:14:58.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:02.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you're right, Aoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need to do everything we can now, including Nagase's part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go look for Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:10.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That was sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:13.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?\NI have to talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll finish off whatever I have left tomorrow, so let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:18.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:22.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you need my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:22.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine by myself.\NInaba's biting the bullet, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:26.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I need to get a hold of myself as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should confront her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.65,0:15:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:32.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just said we'd wait for her to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:35.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acting on impulse isn't a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:36.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you're the last person I want to hear that from.\NI've got a feeling this is going to end poorly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not for Iori, but for you.\NTrust me, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've gotten a lot stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I hope I'm not interrupting anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We did this before, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:02.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Except it was me in your shoes.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:04.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You saved me back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:07.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now it's my turn to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think about this whole emotion transmission thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like, is it hard on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you suffering?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:20.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's hard on me, I guess.\NC-Could you elaborate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:22.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to do whatever I can to help, Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:25.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's anything you {\i1}can{\i0} do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:29.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you, Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:37.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're usually smiling more than anyone else and always trying to make everyone happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.01,0:16:37.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you haven't been smiling at all lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.05,0:16:41.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've saved me so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:43.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything to get you back to your normal self! I—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:47.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you give this "back to normal" crap a rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:54.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it's not just you.\NIt's everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:55.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one sees the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.41,0:16:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:07.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's over. I just can't do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:09.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing's over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:09.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can do anything you set your mind to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't be friends with Yui anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:21.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you, Iori. That will never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:23.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regardless of how much I change?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:25.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.\NEven if everything about me changes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:30.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what part of me do \Nyou want to be friends with?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:36.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If everything about me changes, it won't be me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:39.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may as well be someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:42.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we still have all the things we've done together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, as long as you have a past together,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:49.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no matter how terrible a person becomes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:52.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,even if they turn into a vicious criminal, they're still your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:55.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The person's feelings and nature don't matter to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:17:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.05,0:18:00.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're not the Iori we knew!\N{\i1}That's why I can't be friends with Yui anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:15.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So your friend turned evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:18.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.78,0:18:21.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just being really negative right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:26.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you got anxious and called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:26.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:31.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was hoping a third party would be able to give me some good advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:34.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to help, but I don't know the \Nnitty-gritty of it all, so I can't say much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:34.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're still\Nrelying on others for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:44.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She sure told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, and good afternoon, Kiriyama-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:19:01.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, the sun is down. Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:19:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I shouldn't try to use these greetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.87,0:19:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kiriyama-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.87,0:19:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look rather nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:12.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:15.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, please don't get violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:19.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm much stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:19.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.47,0:19:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were already aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.13,0:19:23.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama-san, what do you think of this phenomenon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:33.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every part of you is exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.35,0:19:35.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every bit of your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.69,0:19:37.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Save me!{what a pussy}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.69,0:19:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yui, where are you?!\N{\i1}Where are you?!\N{\i1}Good! It reached them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:46.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.99,0:19:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aoki and Taichi will definitely come save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.37,0:19:50.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...you're still relying on others for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:57.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:20:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm scared of this emotion \Ntransmission thing. I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I won't run away anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:04.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've made a fool of myself in front of my friends for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.59,0:20:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can know everything\Nabout me. I'm fine with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.59,0:20:10.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not just going to rely on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.39,0:20:10.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're trying their best to deal with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:13.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I need to try my best, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.27,0:20:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be asking my friends to save me.\NI shouldn't be trying to deal\Nwith this on my own, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:22.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need to get through this, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:29.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe doing it this way was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.99,0:20:29.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of it now. Maybe I should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing I say will have any effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:38.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've become very strong, Kiriyama-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:43.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may be even less interesting than Aoki-san.\NBut maybe that's exactly\Nwhat makes this interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.97,0:20:46.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.97,0:20:49.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.35,0:20:51.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good-bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:56.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiriyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.27,0:20:59.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're first, Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:01.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You okay, Kiriyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.11,0:21:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sorry to make you run all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.15,0:21:06.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.\NHe's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:10.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.70,0:21:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?\NThe talk with Iori didn't go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:21.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I might have even made\Nthings more difficult for her.\NYou wouldn't be the first of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:25.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase doesn't even want to see me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:25.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not true at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know Iori's just waiting for you to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, you've gone completely soft!{hehehe}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:36.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You used to thrust yourself into people's problems so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.89,0:21:42.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously, how could you just sit by and \Nwatch Iori get herself into this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:46.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I want to do something for Nagase, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:48.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I don't know what Nagase wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.45,0:21:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{This line should be}I completely messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:54.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:54.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so wishy-washy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.87,0:21:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you just man up already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.33,0:22:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm clueless about what to do, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:03.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I gave it everything I had, only to make things even worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:05.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you mess up, think about how to not mess up the next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:09.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, Kiriyama, could you calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know I've got no right to be lecturing anyone about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:15.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but you're being so freaking useless that I had to say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:19.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever make me do this again, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:19.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:21.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think I'll let you off easy after a little apology?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.77,0:22:21.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think that's all you need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though I guess I {\i1}will{\i0} forgive you.\NTh-Thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:30.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that what I'm supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.03,0:22:36.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kiriyama.\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:40.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's get through this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.37,0:22:42.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.79,0:22:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yui! I'm almost there!{this nigga}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.38,0:22:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It always takes him {\i1}way{\i0} too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or maybe Taichi's just too good at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.05,0:22:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.47,0:22:54.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.{She want dat Taichi dick}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.35,0:23:03.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today's been horrible since it started.\NI broke my favorite hairclip,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.94,0:23:07.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got into a fight with my mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.19,0:23:10.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I overslept,\Nand I'm not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:16.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the thing about life is that something always happens on days like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.45,0:23:18.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap and tell us what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has gone on for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.83,0:23:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.42,0:23:26.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell us what you want from the bottom of your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.67,0:23:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You already know, thanks to this emotion transmission thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.42,0:23:32.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That only tells us bits and pieces! It doesn't tell us everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.59,0:23:35.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to hear everything straight from your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.43,0:23:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to tell {\i1}you{\i0} everything, Inaban?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.43,0:23:43.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori, you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.86,0:23:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to save you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:51.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sound pushy, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.57,0:23:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friends help each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:23:55.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So ask us for help already!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:24:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't force your ideals on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:24:02.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell has gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.79,0:24:07.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not acting like yourself at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.79,0:24:10.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something really is wrong with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:10.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've been like this ever\Nsince you rejected Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.21,0:24:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you're tired of this \Nemotion transmission thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.72,0:24:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.55,0:24:17.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to turn Taichi down?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:18.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.89,0:24:19.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You love Taichi—
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.89,0:24:22.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quit forcing them on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.98,0:24:25.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wanted to know what's in my heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.06,0:24:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.19,0:24:31.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll get to hear it from my own mouth.\NYou're just way too selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.53,0:24:35.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} don't understand {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.53,0:24:38.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You kept trying to force Taichi and me to start dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.32,0:24:41.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Day in and day out, it was just, \N"You two should go out already!"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.45,0:24:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when I finally feel like going out with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.66,0:24:47.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you get between us and say you love him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.46,0:24:52.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But when I said that I wouldn't go out with him, you got angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.22,0:24:55.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell? What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.22,0:24:57.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How selfish can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.72,0:25:02.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fan up my feelings, only to come in after, get in my way, and screw everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.47,0:25:02.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now isn't that {\i1}mean{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.52,0:25:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you ever thought about how {\i1}I{\i0} feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.06,0:25:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should be asking {\i1}you{\i0} what {\i1}you're{\i0} thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.12,0:25:25.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.16,0:25:27.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.16,0:25:28.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I loved Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.17,0:25:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hard work's something that really shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.79,0:25:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...if all five of us can do the presentation together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.67,0:25:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...why you had to make it {\i1}your{\i0} fault?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.80,0:25:39.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve to feel what they feel.
